msgstr "選択した変数"

msgctxt "BayesianBinomialMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian Binomial meta-analysis allows you to conduct a binomial meta-"
"analysis using the Bayesian approach. By default, Bayesian meta-analysis "
"model-averages across models assuming the presence vs. absence of the "
"effect, heterogeneity, and moderation (if specified). The analysis provides "
"pre-specified prior distributions for different effect size measures and "
"fields. The analysis allows you to specify meta-regression, 3-level meta-"
"analysis, and subgroup analysis. The results include estimates of effect "
"sizes, heterogeneity, moderation, and various plots to visualize the "
"results.\n"
"\n"
"The analysis is based on the Bayesian meta-analysis/meta-regression "
"parameterization as outlined in Bartoš et al. (2025) with the binomial-"
"normal model described in Bartoš et al. (2023).\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09850) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"ベイズ二項メタ分析では、ベイズのアプローチで二項のメタ分析を行えます。既定で"
"は、効果・異質性・モデレーション(指定した場合)の有無を仮定したモデルにわたっ"
"てモデル平均します。効果量の指標や分野ごとに、あらかじめ用意された事前分布が"
"使えます。メタ回帰、3水準メタ分析、サブグループ分析を指定できます。結果には効"
"果量・異質性・モデレーションの推定値と、それらを可視化する各種のプロットが含"
"まれます。\n"
"\n"
"この分析は Bartoš et al. (2025) が示したベイズメタ分析・メタ回帰のパラメータ"
"化と、Bartoš et al. (2023) が述べた二項正規モデルに基づいています。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09850)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "BayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Bayesian meta-analysis allows you to conduct a meta-analysis using the "
"Bayesian approach. By default, Bayesian meta-analysis model-averages across "
"models assuming the presence vs. absence of the effect, heterogeneity, and "
"moderation (if specified). The analysis provides pre-specified prior "
"distributions for different effect size measures and fields. Additional care "
"is required when using a different type of effect sizes as the default prior "
"distributions might not match the proper scaling of the effect size and "
"heterogeneity. The analysis allows you to specify meta-regression, 3-level "
"meta-analysis, and subgroup analysis. The results include estimates of "
"effect sizes, heterogeneity, moderation, and various plots to visualize the "
"results.\n"
"\n"
"The analysis is based on the Bayesian meta-analysis/meta-regression "
"parameterization as outlined in Bartoš et al. (2025).\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09850) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"ベイズメタ分析では、ベイズのアプローチでメタ分析を行えます。既定では、効果・"
"異質性・モデレーション(指定した場合)の有無を仮定したモデルにわたってモデル平"
"均します。効果量の指標や分野ごとに、あらかじめ用意された事前分布が使えます。"
"別の種類の効果量を使う場合は、既定の事前分布が効果量と異質性のスケールに合わ"
"ない可能性があるため注意が必要です。メタ回帰、3水準メタ分析、サブグループ分析"
"を指定できます。結果には効果量・異質性・モデレーションの推定値と、それらを可"
"視化する各種のプロットが含まれます。\n"
"\n"
"この分析は Bartoš et al. (2025) が示したベイズメタ分析・メタ回帰のパラメータ"
"化に基づいています。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09850)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Classical meta-analysis allows you to conduct a meta-analysis using the "
"classical approach. It provides options for fixed and random effects models, "
"as well as meta-regression, location-scale models, and subgroup analysis. "
"Additional options include the ability to specify clustering for robust "
"variance estimation, permutation tests, and generating the metafor package R "
"code. The results include estimates of effect sizes, heterogeneity, "
"moderation, and various plots to visualize the results.\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09845) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"古典的メタ分析では、古典的なアプローチでメタ分析を行えます。固定効果モデルと"
"変量効果モデルのほか、メタ回帰、位置尺度モデル、サブグループ分析のオプション"
"があります。さらに、ロバストな分散推定のためのクラスタリング、並べ替え検定、"
"metaforパッケージのRコードの生成も指定できます。結果には効果量・異質性・モデ"
"レーションの推定値と、それらを可視化する各種のプロットが含まれます。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09845)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultilevelMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Classical multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis allows you to conduct a meta-"
"analysis adjusting for the dependency between effect sizes using the "
"classical approach. The effect size dependency can be adjusted for by "
"specifying the 'Effect Size Variance-Covariance Matrix' (interfacing the "
"'vcalc' function) and specifying the 'Random Effects/Model "
"Components' (interfacing the 'random' argument in 'rma.mv' function). It "
"provides options for fixed and random effects models, as well as meta-"
"regression, and subgroup analysis. Additional options include the ability to "
"specify clustering for robust variance estimation, permutation tests, and "
"generating the metafor package R code. The results include estimates of "
"effect sizes, heterogeneity, moderation, and various plots to visualize the "
"results.\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09845) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"古典的なマルチレベル・多変量メタ分析では、古典的なアプローチで効果量どうしの"
"依存を調整したメタ分析を行えます。効果量の依存は、「効果量の分散共分散行列」"
"を指定すること('vcalc'関数を利用します)と、「変量効果・モデルの成分」を指定す"
"ること('rma.mv'関数の'random'引数を利用します)で調整できます。固定効果モデル"
"と変量効果モデルのほか、メタ回帰とサブグループ分析のオプションがあります。さ"
"らに、ロバストな分散推定のためのクラスタリング、並べ替え検定、metaforパッケー"
"ジのRコードの生成も指定できます。結果には効果量・異質性・モデレーションの推定"
"値と、それらを可視化する各種のプロットが含まれます。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09845)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "FunnelPlot|"
msgid ""
"Funnel plots allow you to visualize the observed effect sizes and standard "
"errors with the funnel outlaying the sampling distribution under a given "
"meta-analytic model. Funnel plots are often used to assess publication bias "
"and small-study effects. However, many studies have shown that funnel plots "
"are not very reliable for this purpose. See e.g. Lau et al., (2006) and "
"Terrin et al., (2005).\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09845) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"ファンネルプロットでは、観測された効果量と標準誤差を可視化し、与えられたメタ"
"分析モデルのもとでの標本分布をファンネルとして描けます。ファンネルプロットは"
"出版バイアスや小規模研究効果の評価によく使われます。ただし、この目的にはあま"
"り信頼できないことが多くの研究で示されています。たとえば Lau et al. (2006) "
"や Terrin et al. (2005) を参照してください。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09845)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid "Standard errors"
msgstr "標準誤差"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisStatistics|"
msgid ""
"Include standard errors in the tabular output. Only available when no effect "
"size transformation is applied."
msgstr ""
"表の出力に標準誤差を含めます。効果量の変換を適用していない場合にのみ使えま"
"す。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Robust Bayesian meta-analysis allows you to conduct a publication-bias "
"adjusted meta-analysis using the Bayesian approach. By default, Bayesian "
"meta-analysis model-averages across models assuming the presence vs. absence "
"of the effect, heterogeneity, publication bias, and moderation (if "
"specified). The analysis provides pre-specified prior distributions for "
"different effect size measures and fields. Additional care is required when "
"using a different type of effect sizes as the default prior distributions "
"might not match the proper scaling of the effect size and heterogeneity. The "
"analysis allows you to specify meta-regression, 3-level meta-analysis, and "
"subgroup analysis. The results include estimates of effect sizes, "
"heterogeneity, moderation, and various plots to visualize the results.\n"
"\n"
"The analysis is based on the Bayesian meta-analysis/meta-regression "
"parameterization as outlined in Bartoš et al. (2025).\n"
"\n"
"See [this tutorial](https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2509.09850) for a "
"detailed introduction to the module."
msgstr ""
"ロバストベイズメタ分析では、ベイズのアプローチで出版バイアスを補正したメタ分"
"析を行えます。既定では、効果・異質性・出版バイアス・モデレーション(指定した場"
"合)の有無を仮定したモデルにわたってモデル平均します。効果量の指標や分野ごと"
"に、あらかじめ用意された事前分布が使えます。別の種類の効果量を使う場合は、既"
"定の事前分布が効果量と異質性のスケールに合わない可能性があるため注意が必要で"
"す。メタ回帰、3水準メタ分析、サブグループ分析を指定できます。結果には効果量・"
"異質性・モデレーションの推定値と、それらを可視化する各種のプロットが含まれま"
"す。\n"
"\n"
"この分析は Bartoš et al. (2025) が示したベイズメタ分析・メタ回帰のパラメータ"
"化に基づいています。\n"
"\n"
"モジュールの詳しい入門は[このチュートリアル](https://doi.org/10.48550/"
"arXiv.2509.09850)を参照してください。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect Size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing the observed effect sizes."
msgstr "観測された効果量が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect Size Standard Error"
msgstr "効果量標準誤差"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the standard errors corresponding to the effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量に対応する標準誤差が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size measure"
msgstr "効果量の指標"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Effect size measure supplied as the 'Effect Size'. This is an important "
"setting as it determines the defaul prior distributions and the model "
"fitting transformation."
msgstr ""
"「効果量」として与える効果量の指標です。既定の事前分布とモデルのあてはめの変"
"換を決めるため、重要な設定です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference"
msgstr "標準化平均差"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference such as Cohen's d, Hedge's g"
msgstr "コーエンのdやヘッジのgなどの標準化平均差"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fisher's z"
msgstr "フィッシャー(Fisher)のz"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fisher's z transformation of correlation coefficients"
msgstr "相関係数のフィッシャーのz変換"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log odds ratio"
msgstr "対数オッズ比"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log risk ratio"
msgstr "対数リスク比"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log hazard ratio"
msgstr "対数ハザード比"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Risk difference"
msgstr "リスク差"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"General effect size that does not correspond to any of the measures above. "
"Please, be careful when specifying the prior distributions as no sensible "
"defaults are available."
msgstr ""
"上のいずれの指標にも当てはまらない一般的な効果量です。妥当な既定値がないた"
"め、事前分布の指定には注意してください。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Predictors"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables to include as predictors (moderators) in the meta-regression "
"model. See the 'Model' section for the meta-regression specification details."
msgstr ""
"メタ回帰モデルに予測変数(モデレータ)として含める変数です。メタ回帰の指定の詳"
"細は「モデル」のセクションを参照してください。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Study Level (Multilevel)"
msgstr "研究の水準(マルチレベル)"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating the study level nesting. This variable is used to "
"specify the nesting of the studies in the meta-analysis. The nesting is used "
"to specify the model structure and to account for the correlation between "
"the effect sizes within each study. Note that this is an experimental "
"feature that needs to be manually enabled in the 'Advanced' section."
msgstr ""
"研究の水準の入れ子を示す変数です。この変数はメタ分析における研究の入れ子を指"
"定するのに使います。入れ子はモデルの構造を指定し、各研究内の効果量どうしの相"
"関を考慮するために使われます。これは実験的な機能で、「詳細」のセクションで手"
"動で有効にする必要があることに注意してください。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variable indicating subgroup stratification. For each subgroup, an "
"independent model is fitted to the corresponding data set subset."
msgstr ""
"サブグループの層別を示す変数です。サブグループごとに、対応するデータの部分集"
"合に独立したモデルがあてはめられます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Bayesian Model Averaging"
msgstr "ベイズモデル平均"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify which components should be included Bayesian model averaging. If "
"selected, prior distribution under both the presence and absence of the "
"component are specified. This allows for testing for the presence vs. "
"absence of the component (if the component is not selected, a Bayes factor "
"test is not conducted). The displayed estimates are averaged across null and "
"alternative prior distributions of all specified components."
msgstr ""
"ベイズモデル平均に含める成分を指定します。選ぶと、その成分があるときとないと"
"きの両方の事前分布が指定されます。これにより、成分の有無を検定できます(成分を"
"選ばない場合、ベイズファクターの検定は行われません)。表示される推定値は、指定"
"したすべての成分について、帰無と対立の事前分布にわたって平均されます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Average over the presence vs. absence of the effect. If unspecified, the "
"resulting model assumes that the effect is present."
msgstr ""
"効果があるかないかにわたって平均します。指定しない場合、得られるモデルは効果"
"があることを仮定します。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "異質性"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Average over the presence vs. absence of heterogeneity. If unspecified, the "
"resulting model assumes that heterogeneity is present."
msgstr ""
"異質性があるかないかにわたって平均します。指定しない場合、得られるモデルは異"
"質性があることを仮定します。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Moderation"
msgstr "調整"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Average over the presence vs. absence of moderators. If unspecified, the "
"resulting model assumes that all moderators models are present."
msgstr ""
"モデレータがあるかないかにわたって平均します。指定しない場合、得られるモデル"
"はすべてのモデレータのモデルがあることを仮定します。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Publication bias"
msgstr "出版バイアス"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Average over the presence vs. absence of publication bias. If unspecified, "
"the resulting model assumes that publication bias is present."
msgstr ""
"出版バイアスがあるかないかにわたって平均します。指定しない場合、得られるモデ"
"ルは出版バイアスがあることを仮定します。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior Distributions"
msgstr "事前分布"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size and heterogeneity"
msgstr "効果量と異質性"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the type of prior distributions for the effect size and "
"heterogeneity."
msgstr "効果量と異質性の事前分布の種類を指定します。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "既定"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Use default prior distributions for the effect size and heterogeneity based "
"on Bartoš et al. (2022)."
msgstr ""
"Bartoš et al. (2022) に基づく、効果量と異質性の既定の事前分布を使います。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Medicine"
msgstr "医学"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Use prior distributions based on the Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews "
"developed by Bartoš et al. (2021)"
msgstr ""
"Bartoš et al. (2021) が Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews に基づいて"
"作った事前分布を使います"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "カスタム"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Use custom prior distributions. This option allows you to specify a custom "
"model ensemble for the effect size and heterogeneity prior distributions."
msgstr ""
"カスタムの事前分布を使います。このオプションでは、効果量と異質性の事前分布に"
"ついて、モデルのアンサンブルを自分で指定できます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Use prior distributions based on the Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews "
"developed by Bartoš et al. (2023)."
msgstr ""
"Bartoš et al. (2023) が Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews に基づいて"
"作った事前分布を使います。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "スケール"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Setting value different than 1 re-scales the pre-specified prior "
"distributions. Values smaller than 1 lead to more informative priors, while "
"values larger than 1 lead to less informative priors."
msgstr ""
"1以外の値を設定すると、あらかじめ指定された事前分布が再スケーリングされます。"
"1より小さい値では情報の多い事前分布に、1より大きい値では情報の少ない事前分布"
"になります。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Publication bias adjustment"
msgstr "出版バイアスの補正"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Publication bias adjustment method. The default is the RoBMA-PSMA method "
"(combination of 6 weight functions and PET-PEESE)."
msgstr ""
"出版バイアスの補正の方法です。既定はRoBMA-PSMA法(6つの重み関数とPET-PEESEの組"
"み合わせ)です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "RoBMA-PSMA"
msgstr "RoBMA-PSMA"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"RoBMA-PSMA method (combination of 6 weight functions and PET-PEESE) as "
"described in Bartoš et al. (2022). This is the recommended method."
msgstr ""
"Bartoš et al. (2022) が述べたRoBMA-PSMA法(6つの重み関数とPET-PEESEの組み合わ"
"せ)です。推奨される方法です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "RoBMA-PP"
msgstr "RoBMA-PP"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"RoBMA PET-PEESE method. A simplification of the RoBMA-PSMA method that uses "
"only the PET-PEESE weight function."
msgstr ""
"RoBMAのPET-PEESE法です。RoBMA-PSMA法を単純にしたもので、PET-PEESEの重み関数の"
"みを使います。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "RoBMA-original"
msgstr "RoBMA-original"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Original RoBMA method (combination of 2 weight functions) as described in "
"Maier et al. (2023)."
msgstr ""
"Maier et al. (2023) が述べた元のRoBMA法(2つの重み関数の組み合わせ)です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Custom model ensemble. This option allows you to specify a custom model "
"ensemble for the publication bias adjustment."
msgstr ""
"カスタムのモデルのアンサンブルです。このオプションでは、出版バイアスの補正に"
"ついて、モデルのアンサンブルを自分で指定できます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "No publication bias adjustment."
msgstr "出版バイアスの補正を行いません。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Expected direction of the effect"
msgstr "予想される効果の向き"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The expected direction of the effect. This setting is important for the "
"publication bias adjustment (one-sided selection models specify different "
"publication probabilities for estimates in the expected vs. unexpected "
"direction and PET-PEESE is bounded to adjust in the expected direction). The "
"default is 'Positive'."
msgstr ""
"予想される効果の向きです。この設定は出版バイアスの補正で重要です(片側の選択モ"
"デルは、予想される向きと予想外の向きの推定値に別々の出版確率を与え、PET-PEESE"
"は予想される向きに補正するよう制約されます)。既定は「正」です。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Detect"
msgstr "自動判定"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Determine the expected direction of the effect automatically based on the "
"median effect size in the data."
msgstr ""
"データの効果量の中央値に基づいて、予想される効果の向きを自動的に決めます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Positive"
msgstr "正"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Positive effect"
msgstr "正の効果"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Negative"
msgstr "負"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Negative effect"
msgstr "負の効果"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Show model specification"
msgstr "モデルの指定を表示"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show the model specification. This is useful for understanding and reporting "
"the specified model."
msgstr ""
"モデルの指定を表示します。指定したモデルを理解し報告するのに役立ちます。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Prior Distributions (Custom)"
msgstr "事前分布(カスタム)"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Effect Size Aggregation"
msgstr "効果量の集約"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Forest Plot"
msgstr "フォレストプロット"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Risk of Bias Plot"
msgstr "バイアスのリスクのプロット"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Multilevel/Multivariate Meta-Analysis"
msgstr "マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Classical Multilevel/Multivariate Meta-Analysis"
msgstr "古典的なマルチレベル・多変量メタ分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Generalized (GLMM) Meta-Analysis"
msgstr "一般化(GLMM)メタ分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Classical Generalized (GLMM) Meta-Analysis"
msgstr "古典的な一般化(GLMM)メタ分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Mantel-Haenszel / Peto"
msgstr "Mantel-Haenszel / Peto"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Generalized (GLMM) meta-analysis fits meta-analytic models via generalized "
"linear (mixed-effects) models using metafor's rma.glmm function. It directly "
"models event counts and proportions without requiring pre-computed effect "
"sizes, making it suitable for sparse binary and count data where the normal "
"approximation breaks down."
msgstr ""
"一般化(GLMM)メタ分析では、metaforのrma.glmm関数を使い、一般化線形(混合効果)モ"
"デルによってメタ分析モデルをあてはめます。あらかじめ効果量を計算しておく必要"
"がなく、イベント数や割合を直接モデル化します。正規近似が成り立たない、疎な2値"
"データやカウントデータに適しています。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Events Group 1"
msgstr "イベント数 群1"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Events Group 2"
msgstr "イベント数 群2"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Sample Size Group 1"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ 群1"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Sample Size Group 2"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ 群2"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Person-Time Group 1"
msgstr "人時 群1"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Person-Time Group 2"
msgstr "人時 群2"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Effect size measure"
msgstr "効果量の指標"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the effect size measure to be used in the generalized meta-analysis."
msgstr "一般化メタ分析で使う効果量の指標を選びます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log odds ratio"
msgstr "対数オッズ比"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log risk ratio"
msgstr "対数リスク比"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Risk difference"
msgstr "リスク差"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Log incidence rate ratio"
msgstr "対数発生率比"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Model type"
msgstr "モデルの種類"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the generalized linear model type. UM.FS = unconditional with fixed "
"study effects (default); UM.RS = unconditional with random study effects; CM."
"AL = conditional with approximate likelihood (odds ratios only); CM.EL = "
"conditional with exact likelihood (odds ratios and incidence rate ratios)."
msgstr ""
"一般化線形モデルの種類を選びます。UM.FS は研究の固定効果を含む非条件付き(既"
"定)、UM.RS は研究の変量効果を含む非条件付き、CM.AL は近似尤度による条件付き"
"(オッズ比のみ)、CM.EL は厳密尤度による条件付き(オッズ比と発生率比)です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Unconditional (fixed study effects)"
msgstr "非条件付き(研究の固定効果)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Unconditional (random study effects)"
msgstr "非条件付き(研究の変量効果)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Conditional (approximate likelihood)"
msgstr "条件付き(近似尤度)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Conditional (exact likelihood)"
msgstr "条件付き(厳密尤度)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the estimation method. Maximum Likelihood estimates a random-effects "
"model; Equal Effects fixes tau-squared to zero."
msgstr ""
"推定法を選びます。最尤法は変量効果モデルを推定し、等効果はtauの二乗を0に固定"
"します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum Likelihood"
msgstr "最尤"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Equal Effects"
msgstr "等効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficient test"
msgstr "係数の検定"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Test type for the fixed-effect coefficients: z (Wald test) or t (t-"
"distribution)."
msgstr ""
"固定効果の係数の検定の種類です。z(ワルド検定)またはt(t分布)を選べます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "z"
msgstr "z"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "t"
msgstr "t"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Predictors"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Variables to include as predictors (moderators) in a meta-regression model."
msgstr "メタ回帰モデルに予測変数(モデレータ)として含める変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Study Labels"
msgstr "研究ラベル"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable containing labels for the studies."
msgstr "研究のラベルが入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Variable indicating subgroup stratification."
msgstr "サブグループの層別を示す変数です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Method used for model estimation in the meta-analysis. The available methods "
"depend on the inclusion of heterogeneity model terms."
msgstr ""
"メタ分析でモデルの推定に使う方法です。使える方法は、異質性のモデル項を含める"
"かどうかで変わります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Unrestricted Weighted Least Squares (UWLS)"
msgstr "制約なし重みつき最小二乗法(UWLS)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed effects test"
msgstr "固定効果の検定"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid ""
"Effect Size Aggregation allows you to combine multiple effect sizes or "
"outcomes from the same study into a single aggregate effect size.This is "
"useful when a study reports multiple outcomes that should be treated as a "
"single unit. Note that multilevel and multivariate models available in the "
"Classical Meta-Analysis (Multilevel/Multivariate) option are preferable for "
"analyzing such structures."
msgstr ""
"効果量の集約では、同じ研究から得られた複数の効果量やアウトカムを、1つの集約さ"
"れた効果量にまとめられます。1つの研究が複数のアウトカムを報告していて、それら"
"を1つの単位として扱うべき場合に役立ちます。ただし、そうした構造の分析には、古"
"典的メタ分析(マルチレベル・多変量)のオプションで使えるマルチレベルモデルや多"
"変量モデルの方が望ましいことに注意してください。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Effect Size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Variable containing the observed effect sizes."
msgstr "観測された効果量が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Effect Size Standard Error"
msgstr "効果量標準誤差"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Variable containing the standard errors of the effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量の標準誤差が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "クラスタ"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid ""
"Variable identifying the cluster (e.g., study) to aggregate effect sizes "
"within."
msgstr "効果量を集約する単位となるクラスタ(研究など)を識別する変数です。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "オプション"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Show metafor R code"
msgstr "metaforのRコードを表示"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid ""
"Display the underlying R code used by the metafor package to aggregate the "
"effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量の集約にmetaforパッケージが使っているRコードを表示します。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Compute sampling variance"
msgstr "標本分散を計算する"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Inverse-variance weighting"
msgstr "分散の逆数による重みづけ"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Use inverse-variance weighting when aggregating effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量を集約するときに、分散の逆数による重みづけを使います。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Add cluster size column"
msgstr "クラスタの大きさの列を追加"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Add a column with the number of effect sizes per cluster."
msgstr "クラスタごとの効果量の数を示す列を追加します。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Aggregated Column Names"
msgstr "集約後の列の名前"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Standard error"
msgstr "標準誤差"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Sampling variance"
msgstr "標本分散"

msgctxt "EffectSizeAggregation|"
msgid "Cluster size"
msgstr "クラスタの大きさ"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Group 1/Outcome + (Events)"
msgstr "群1/アウトカム +(イベント)"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Group 1/Outcome - (Non-Events)"
msgstr "群1/アウトカム -(非イベント)"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Group 2/Outcome + (Events)"
msgstr "群2/アウトカム +(イベント)"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Group 2/Outcome - (Non-Events)"
msgstr "群2/アウトカム -(非イベント)"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Small sample correction"
msgstr "小標本の補正"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid ""
"Apply the small-sample bias correction for standardized mean differences."
msgstr "標準化平均差に小標本のバイアス補正を適用します。"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid "Show metafor R code"
msgstr "metaforのRコードを表示"

msgctxt "EffectSizeComputation|"
msgid ""
"Display the underlying R code used by the metafor package to compute the "
"effect sizes."
msgstr "効果量の計算にmetaforパッケージが使っているRコードを表示します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Create a forest plot from pre-computed effect sizes and confidence intervals "
"without fitting a meta-analytic model. This allows visualizing results from "
"any source — external software, individual studies, or custom computations."
msgstr ""
"メタ分析モデルをあてはめずに、あらかじめ計算した効果量と信頼区間からフォレス"
"トプロットを作ります。外部ソフトウェア、個々の研究、独自の計算など、どのよう"
"な出所の結果でも可視化できます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Variable containing the effect size estimates."
msgstr "効果量の推定値が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Effect Size Standard Error"
msgstr "効果量標準誤差"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing the standard errors. Used to compute confidence "
"intervals when not provided directly, and to determine point sizes via "
"inverse-variance weights when no weight variable is specified."
msgstr ""
"標準誤差が入っている変数です。信頼区間が直接与えられていない場合の計算に使わ"
"れ、重みの変数を指定していない場合には分散の逆数による重みで点の大きさを決め"
"るのにも使われます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Confidence Interval"
msgstr "信頼区間"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Two variables specifying the lower and upper bounds of the confidence "
"interval. If not provided, intervals are computed from the standard error at "
"the 95%% level."
msgstr ""
"信頼区間の下限と上限を指定する2つの変数です。与えない場合、標準誤差から95%%水"
"準で区間が計算されます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Prediction Interval"
msgstr "予測区間"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Two variables specifying the lower and upper bounds of the prediction "
"interval. Displayed as rectangles behind estimate diamonds."
msgstr ""
"予測区間の下限と上限を指定する2つの変数です。推定値のひし形の背後に長方形とし"
"て表示されます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "重み"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing study weight. When specified, study points are scaled by "
"these weights and the study weights can be shown in the study information "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"研究の重みが入っている変数です。指定すると、研究の点がこの重みで拡大縮小さ"
"れ、研究情報のパネルに重みを表示できます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable controlling the vertical positioning of rows. The first position "
"appears at the top of the figure. If not provided, the dataset row order is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"行の縦方向の位置を制御する変数です。最初の位置が図の一番上になります。与えな"
"い場合、データセットの行順が使われます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Visualization Type"
msgstr "可視化の種類"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Nominal variable whose levels distinguish study rows (displayed as points "
"with intervals) from estimate rows (displayed as diamonds)."
msgstr ""
"研究の行(区間つきの点で表示)と推定値の行(ひし形で表示)を区別する水準を持つ名"
"義変数です。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Study"
msgstr "研究"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Visualization Type variable that indicates the "
"study visualization type."
msgstr "「可視化の種類」の変数で、研究の可視化を示す値を指定します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Visualization Type variable that indicates the "
"estimate visualization type."
msgstr "「可視化の種類」の変数で、推定値の可視化を示す値を指定します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Nominal variable defining subgroups. Each subgroup is displayed as a "
"separate panel in the forest plot."
msgstr ""
"サブグループを定める名義変数です。サブグループごとにフォレストプロットの別々"
"のパネルとして表示されます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Transform effect size"
msgstr "効果量を変換する"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid ""
"Apply a transformation to the effect sizes and confidence intervals for "
"display."
msgstr "表示のために、効果量と信頼区間に変換を適用します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Fisher's z to r"
msgstr "フィッシャー(Fisher)のzからrへ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指数"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Log odds to proportions"
msgstr "対数オッズから割合へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Log odds to SMD (normal)"
msgstr "対数オッズからSMDへ(正規)"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Log odds to SMD (logistic)"
msgstr "対数オッズからSMDへ(ロジスティック)"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to log odds (normal)"
msgstr "SMDから対数オッズへ(正規)"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to log odds (logistic)"
msgstr "SMDから対数オッズへ(ロジスティック)"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Hakstian & Whalen inverse α"
msgstr "Hakstian & Whalen の逆α"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Bonett inverse α"
msgstr "Bonett の逆α"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Z to R²"
msgstr "ZからR²へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₁"
msgstr "SMDからコーエンのU₁へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₂"
msgstr "SMDからコーエンのU₂へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to Cohen's U₃"
msgstr "SMDからコーエンのU₃へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "SMD to CLES, Pr(superiority)"
msgstr "SMDからCLES(優越の確率)へ"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Study Information"
msgstr "研究の情報"

msgctxt "ForestPlot|"
msgid "Estimate Information"
msgstr "推定値の情報"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "詳細"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Advanced options for the generalized (GLMM) meta-analysis."
msgstr "一般化(GLMM)メタ分析の詳細オプションです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Show metafor R code"
msgstr "metaforのRコードを表示"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Display the underlying metafor R code used for the analysis."
msgstr "分析にmetaforが使っているRコードを表示します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Subgroup Analysis"
msgstr "サブグループ分析"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Include full dataset"
msgstr "全データを含める"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Include the full dataset estimate alongside the subgroup estimates."
msgstr "サブグループの推定値とあわせて、全データの推定値を含めます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "GLMM Settings"
msgstr "GLMMの設定"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Settings specific to the generalized linear mixed model."
msgstr "一般化線形混合モデルに固有の設定です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Group coding"
msgstr "群のコーディング"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Coding for the group variable in unconditional models. Contrast (plus/minus "
"1/2) centers the intercept at the average log odds; Treatment (0/1) sets the "
"intercept to the reference group."
msgstr ""
"非条件付きモデルにおける群の変数のコーディングです。対比(±1/2)は切片を平均の"
"対数オッズの位置に中心化し、処置(0/1)は切片を参照群の値にします。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Contrast (±½)"
msgstr "対比(±½)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Treatment (0/1, group 1 = 1)"
msgstr "処置(0/1、群1 = 1)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Treatment (0/1, group 2 = 1)"
msgstr "処置(0/1、群2 = 1)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Correlated random effects"
msgstr "相関のある変量効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Allow correlated random effects in the UM.RS model (random study effects and "
"random treatment effects can be correlated)."
msgstr ""
"UM.RSモデルで変量効果どうしの相関を許します(研究の変量効果と処置の変量効果が"
"相関しうるようになります)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Quadrature points (nAGQ)"
msgstr "求積点の数(nAGQ)"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Number of quadrature points for the adaptive Gauss-Hermite approximation of "
"the log-likelihood. Higher values increase accuracy but slow down estimation."
msgstr ""
"対数尤度を適応的ガウス・エルミート法で近似するときの求積点の数です。大きくす"
"ると精度は上がりますが、推定は遅くなります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Handling of Zero Frequencies"
msgstr "度数が0の場合の扱い"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Options for handling zero cell frequencies in the data. These affect the "
"computation of observed effect sizes displayed in plots but do not affect "
"the GLMM model fit itself."
msgstr ""
"データにセルの度数0がある場合の扱い方のオプションです。これはプロットに表示さ"
"れる観測された効果量の計算に影響しますが、GLMM自体のあてはめには影響しませ"
"ん。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add to zero cells"
msgstr "0のセルに加える値"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Value to add to zero cells when computing observed effect sizes for plots."
msgstr "プロット用に観測された効果量を計算するとき、0のセルに加える値です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Add to"
msgstr "加える対象"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "When to apply the continuity correction for zero cells."
msgstr "0のセルに対して連続性の補正をどのような場合に適用するかを指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "All studies"
msgstr "すべての研究"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Only zero-cell studies"
msgstr "0のセルがある研究のみ"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "If any zero-cell study"
msgstr "0のセルがある研究が1つでもある場合"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Drop studies with no cases or events"
msgstr "ケース・イベントがない研究を除く"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Whether to drop studies that have no cases/events in both groups from the "
"analysis."
msgstr "両群ともケース・イベントがない研究を分析から除くかどうかを指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "はい"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "No"
msgstr "いいえ"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Extend Metafor Call"
msgstr "metaforの呼び出しを拡張"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid "Extend metafor call"
msgstr "metaforの呼び出しを拡張"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Extend the metafor function call with custom R code. Arguments are passed as "
"additional named arguments to rma.glmm()."
msgstr ""
"metaforの関数呼び出しをカスタムのRコードで拡張します。引数は rma.glmm() に追"
"加の名前付き引数として渡されます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalGeneralizedMetaAnalysisAdvanced|"
msgid ""
"Custom R code to extend the metafor call (e.g., 'control = list(maxiter = "
"1000)')."
msgstr ""
"metaforの呼び出しを拡張するカスタムのRコードです(たとえば 'control = "
"list(maxiter = 1000)')。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export"
msgstr "書き出し"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Options for exporting model-derived quantities to the dataset."
msgstr "モデルから得られる量をデータセットに書き出すオプションです。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診断"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Influential cases"
msgstr "影響の大きいケース"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export an indicator for influential cases."
msgstr "影響の大きいケースを示す指標を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Case diagnostics"
msgstr "ケースの診断"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export casewise residual, Cook's distance, leverage, and weight diagnostics "
"where available."
msgstr ""
"利用できる場合、ケースごとの残差、クックの距離、てこ比、重みの診断を書き出し"
"ます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Model impact"
msgstr "モデルへの影響"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export diagnostics for how individual cases affect the model fit."
msgstr "個々のケースがモデルの適合にどう影響するかの診断を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Coefficient influence"
msgstr "係数への影響"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export coefficient influence diagnostics."
msgstr "係数への影響の診断を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Residuals"
msgstr "残差"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "生"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export raw residuals."
msgstr "生の残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Pearson"
msgstr "ピアソン"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export Pearson residuals."
msgstr "ピアソン残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Standardized"
msgstr "標準化"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export standardized residuals."
msgstr "標準化残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Studentized"
msgstr "スチューデント化"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export studentized residuals."
msgstr "スチューデント化残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Conditional standardized"
msgstr "条件つき標準化"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export conditional standardized residuals."
msgstr "条件つき標準化残差を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Model Values"
msgstr "モデルの値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Predicted values"
msgstr "予測値"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export predicted values and interval bounds."
msgstr "予測値と区間の上下限を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "True effect estimates (BLUPs)"
msgstr "真の効果の推定値(BLUP)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export best linear unbiased predictions of the study-specific true effects."
msgstr "研究ごとの真の効果について、最良線形不偏予測を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Random effects"
msgstr "変量効果"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Export predicted random effects."
msgstr "予測された変量効果を書き出します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisExport|"
msgid ""
"Export model fitting weights. These are not coefficient-specific "
"contribution weights in meta-regression. For multilevel/multivariate models, "
"diagonal weights match the default forest plot weights and row-sum weights "
"are exported for intercept-only models."
msgstr ""
"モデルのあてはめの重みを書き出します。これはメタ回帰における係数ごとの寄与の"
"重みではありません。マルチレベル・多変量モデルでは、対角の重みが既定のフォレ"
"ストプロットの重みと一致し、切片のみのモデルでは行和の重みが書き出されます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Effect size model (location)"
msgstr "効果量のモデル(位置)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid ""
"Specify the meta-regression model for the location (effect size) parameter. "
"The simple terms are automatically filled in from the 'Predictors' variable "
"input."
msgstr ""
"位置(効果量)のパラメータについてメタ回帰モデルを指定します。単純な項は「予測"
"変数」の入力から自動的に埋められます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid "Heterogeneity model (scale)"
msgstr "異質性のモデル(尺度)"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisModel|"
msgid ""
"Specify the meta-regression model for the scale (heterogeneity) parameter. "
"Unavailable when performing multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"尺度(異質性)のパラメータについてメタ回帰モデルを指定します。マルチレベル・多"
"変量メタ分析を行う場合には利用できません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Effect Size Variance-Covariance Matrix"
msgstr "効果量の分散共分散行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Options for specifying the approximate variance-covariance matrix of the "
"effect sizes. This matrix is used to account for the correlation between "
"effect sizes when they are not independent."
msgstr ""
"効果量の近似的な分散共分散行列を指定するオプションです。この行列は、効果量が"
"独立でない場合にその相関を考慮するために使われます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "タイプ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Type of variance-covariance matrix input method."
msgstr "分散共分散行列の入力方法の種類です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "単純"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Specify a simple parametric correlation structure for sampling errors within "
"clusters."
msgstr ""
"クラスタ内の標本抽出誤差について、単純なパラメトリックの相関構造を指定しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Correlation matrix"
msgstr "相関行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Use a list of variables to specify the correlation matrix of studies "
"corresponding to the same cluster. Corresponds to the `rvars` option in the "
"metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"同じクラスタに属する研究の相関行列を、変数のリストで指定します。metafor"
"の'vcalc'関数の `rvars` オプションに対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Constructs, groups, and times"
msgstr "構成概念・群・時点"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Specify constructs, groups, and times of the measurement to specify the "
"correlation matrix of studies corresponding to the same cluster."
msgstr ""
"同じクラスタに属する研究の相関行列を指定するために、測定の構成概念・群・時点"
"を指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Precomputed"
msgstr "計算済み"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Load a csv file containing the precomputed variance-covariance matrix."
msgstr "計算済みの分散共分散行列が入ったcsvファイルを読み込みます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "構造"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Independent"
msgstr "独立"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Compound symmetry"
msgstr "複合対称"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Autoregressive"
msgstr "自己回帰"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Compound symmetry + autoregressive"
msgstr "複合対称 + 自己回帰"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Compound symmetry × autoregressive"
msgstr "複合対称 × 自己回帰"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Parametric correlation structure for sampling errors within clusters. "
"'Compound symmetry + autoregressive' assumes a constant baseline correlation "
"plus additional correlation that decays over time. 'Compound symmetry × "
"autoregressive' assumes the constant correlation and the time-based decay "
"act jointly, so correlation vanishes at large time lags."
msgstr ""
"クラスタ内の標本抽出誤差についてのパラメトリックな相関構造です。「複合対称 + "
"自己回帰」は、一定のベースラインの相関に加えて、時間とともに減衰する相関があ"
"ることを仮定します。「複合対称 × 自己回帰」は、一定の相関と時間による減衰が同"
"時に働くことを仮定するため、時間のラグが大きくなると相関は消えます。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Compound Symmetry"
msgstr "複合対称"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct"
msgstr "構成概念"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable identifying the construct, outcome, or endpoint measured by each "
"effect size. Required for compound symmetry times autoregressive structures."
msgstr ""
"各効果量が測っている構成概念・アウトカム・エンドポイントを識別する変数です。"
"複合対称×自己回帰の構造では必須です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Within cluster correlation"
msgstr "クラスタ内の相関"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Assumed correlation between sampling errors within clusters (compound "
"symmetry)."
msgstr "クラスタ内の標本抽出誤差どうしに仮定する相関です(複合対称)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time"
msgstr "時間"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of each effect size, required for "
"autoregressive (CAR) structures."
msgstr "各効果量の時点を指定する変数です。自己回帰(CAR)の構造では必須です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Lag 1 correlation"
msgstr "ラグ1の相関"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Correlation for lag-1 time points in autoregressive structures."
msgstr "自己回帰の構造におけるラグ1の時点の相関です。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Effect size variance-covariance matrix file"
msgstr "効果量の分散共分散行列のファイル"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the precomputed effect size variance-covariance matrix. "
"The matrix needs to match the dimensions of the data set and cannot contain "
"any other variables or names."
msgstr ""
"計算済みの効果量の分散共分散行列が入ったCSVファイルです。行列はデータセットの"
"次元と一致している必要があり、ほかの変数や名前を含めることはできません。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "相関行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the correlation between the individual estimates within "
"cluster. The column order of the variable correspond to the row order of "
"effect size estimates within cluster. Only the lower triangle needs to be "
"specified. Corresponds to the `rvars` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' "
"function."
msgstr ""
"クラスタ内の個々の推定値どうしの相関を指定する変数です。変数の列の順序は、ク"
"ラスタ内の効果量の推定値の行の順序に対応します。下三角のみ指定すれば足りま"
"す。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `rvars` オプションに対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the construct measured by the effect size. Corresponds "
"to the `obs` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"効果量が測っている構成概念を指定する変数です。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `obs` オ"
"プションに対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Type"
msgstr "構成概念の種類"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the type of construct measured by the effect size. "
"Construct Type corresponds to a higher level grouping of the Constructs. "
"Corresponds to the `type` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"効果量が測っている構成概念の種類を指定する変数です。構成概念の種類は、構成概"
"念をより上位でまとめたものです。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `type` オプションに対"
"応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time 1"
msgstr "時点1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of the effect size measurement. In case "
"multiple time points are specified, the first time corresponds to the first "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"効果量を測定した時点を指定する変数です。複数の時点を指定する場合、1つ目の時点"
"が1つ目の条件に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time 2"
msgstr "時点2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of the effect size measurement. In case "
"multiple time points are specified, the second time corresponds to the "
"second condition."
msgstr ""
"効果量を測定した時点を指定する変数です。複数の時点を指定する場合、2つ目の時点"
"が2つ目の条件に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group 1"
msgstr "群1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the group of the first condition when the observed "
"effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. "
"Corresponds to the `grp1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"観測された効果量やアウトカムが2つの条件の対比を表す場合に、1つ目の条件の群を"
"指定する変数です。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `grp1` 引数に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group 2"
msgstr "群2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the group of the second condition when the observed "
"effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. "
"Corresponds to the `grp1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"観測された効果量やアウトカムが2つの条件の対比を表す場合に、2つ目の条件の群を"
"指定する変数です。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `grp1` 引数に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group Size 1"
msgstr "群の大きさ1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the size of the group (or more generally, the inverse-"
"sampling variance weight) of the first condition when the observed effect "
"sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. Corresponds to "
"the `w1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr ""
"観測された効果量やアウトカムが2つの条件の対比を表す場合に、1つ目の条件の群の"
"大きさ(より一般には標本分散の逆数による重み)を指定する変数です。metafor"
"の'vcalc'関数の `w1` 引数に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group Size 2"
msgstr "群の大きさ2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Optional numeric vector to specify the size of the group (or more generally, "
"the inverse-sampling variance weight) of the second condition when the "
"observed effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two "
"conditions. Corresponds to the `w2` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' "
"function."
msgstr ""
"観測された効果量やアウトカムが2つの条件の対比を表す場合に、2つ目の条件の群の"
"大きさ(より一般には標本分散の逆数による重み)を指定する数値ベクトルです(任"
"意)。metaforの'vcalc'関数の `w2` 引数に対応します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Subcluster"
msgstr "サブクラスタ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying additional structure of the subgroups. Effect sizes "
"within the same cluster with different values of the cluster variable are "
"assumed to be independent. Note that this input corresponds to the "
"'subgroup' option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function and is renamed for "
"differentiation from subgroup analysis. "
msgstr ""
"サブグループの追加の構造を指定する変数です。同じクラスタ内でもこの変数の値が"
"異なる効果量は、互いに独立と仮定されます。この入力はmetaforの'vcalc'関数の "
"'subgroup' オプションに対応しますが、サブグループ分析と区別するために名前を変"
"えています。 "

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "クラスタ"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying clustering of the effect sizes for computing the "
"variance covariance matrix. Effect sizes with different values of the "
"cluster variable are assumed to be independent. Note that this input differs "
"from the 'Clustering' option in the data input which is used to specify "
"cluster-robust standard error. In most cases however, both input should "
"contain the same variable."
msgstr ""
"分散共分散行列を計算するために効果量のクラスタを指定する変数です。この変数の"
"値が異なる効果量は、互いに独立と仮定されます。この入力は、クラスタに頑健な標"
"準誤差を指定するためのデータ入力の「クラスタリング」のオプションとは異なるこ"
"とに注意してください。ただし多くの場合、どちらにも同じ変数を指定することにな"
"ります。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "構成概念の相関行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Common correlation"
msgstr "共通の相関"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Specify the correlation between the same construct levels."
msgstr "同じ構成概念の水準どうしの相関を指定します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the correlation matrix between the constructs levels. "
"The first row and the first column of the file must contain names that map "
"the matrix entries to the construct level names (the names cannot start with "
"a number)."
msgstr ""
"構成概念の水準どうしの相関行列が入ったCSVファイルです。ファイルの1行目と1列目"
"には、行列の要素を構成概念の水準名に対応づける名前が必要です(名前を数字で始め"
"ることはできません)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Type Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "構成概念の種類の相関行列"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the correlation matrix between the constructs type "
"level. The first row and the first column of the file must contain names "
"that map the matrix entries to the construct level type names (the names "
"cannot start with a number)."
msgstr ""
"構成概念の種類の水準どうしの相関行列が入ったCSVファイルです。ファイルの1行目"
"と1列目には、行列の要素を構成概念の種類の水準名に対応づける名前が必要です(名"
"前を数字で始めることはできません)。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time lag 1 correlation"
msgstr "時間ラグ1の相関"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Check positive definiteness"
msgstr "正定値性を確認する"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Check if the variance-covariance matrix is symmetric."
msgstr "分散共分散行列が対称かどうかを確認します。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Force positive definiteness"
msgstr "正定値性を強制する"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Force the variance-covariance matrix to be positive definite. This option "
"shuld be used with caution as non-positive definite matricies often indicate "
"input misspecification."
msgstr ""
"分散共分散行列が正定値になるように強制します。正定値でない行列は入力の誤りを"
"示していることが多いため、このオプションは慎重に使ってください。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Save computed variance-covariance matrix"
msgstr "計算した分散共分散行列を保存する"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Selected Variables"
msgstr "選択した変数"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid ""
"Select variables containing estimate-level information to be printed in the "
"left section of the panel for estimate rows."
msgstr ""
"推定値の行について、パネルの左側に表示する推定値ごとの情報が入っている変数を"
"選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "タイトル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "幅"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "配置"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid ""
"Adjust the Title, Width, and Alignment of each column in the left section "
"for estimate rows."
msgstr "推定値の行について、左側の各列のタイトル・幅・配置を調整します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中央"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Forest Plot"
msgstr "フォレストプロット"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Options for visualizing study-level information, estimated marginal means, "
"and the model information in an all encompassing forest plot. Different "
"sections of the forest plot can be individually enabled/disabled."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報、推定周辺平均、モデルの情報を1つのフォレストプロットにまとめて"
"可視化するオプションです。フォレストプロットの各セクションは個別に表示・非表"
"示を切り替えられます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Study information"
msgstr "研究の情報"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Add study-level information panel to the forest plot. There are three "
"sections of the study-level information panel: a) the left section with "
"study labels, names, and etc designed via the 'Selected Variables' option, "
"b) the middle section visualizing the estimates and confidence intervals "
"based on the meta-analytic input, c) the right section textually summarizing "
"the estimates and confidence intervals based on the meta-analytic input."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報のパネルをフォレストプロットに追加します。このパネルは3つのセク"
"ションからなります。a) 左側は「選択した変数」のオプションで指定した研究のラベ"
"ルや名前など、b) 中央はメタ分析の入力に基づく推定値と信頼区間の可視化、c) 右"
"側は同じ推定値と信頼区間を文章でまとめたものです。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Estimated marginal means"
msgstr "推定周辺平均"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Add estimated marginal means information to the forest plot. Available when "
"effect size meta-regression is specified."
msgstr ""
"推定周辺平均の情報をフォレストプロットに追加します。効果量のメタ回帰を指定し"
"た場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Model Variables"
msgstr "モデルの変数"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Selected Variables"
msgstr "選択した変数"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Select variables for which the estimated marginal means are visualized."
msgstr "推定周辺平均を可視化する対象の変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Term tests"
msgstr "項の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus term test of variables included in the estimated "
"marginal means. The null hypothesis states that the effect size at all "
"levels of the categorical variable are equal or that there is no linear "
"association between the effect size and the continuous variable."
msgstr ""
"推定周辺平均に含めた変数について、オムニバスな項の検定を含めます。帰無仮説"
"は、カテゴリカル変数のすべての水準で効果量が等しい、あるいは効果量と連続変数"
"の間に線形の関連がない、というものです。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Coefficient tests"
msgstr "係数の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include coefficient tests of variables included in the estimated marginal "
"means. The null hypothesis states that the estimated marginal mean for a "
"given level equals the tested value."
msgstr ""
"推定周辺平均に含めた変数について、係数の検定を含めます。帰無仮説は、ある水準"
"の推定周辺平均が検定する値に等しい、というものです。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Against"
msgstr "比較する値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Specify the test value for the coefficient tests."
msgstr "係数の検定で使う検定値を指定します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Coefficient tests against 0"
msgstr "0と比較する係数の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include coefficient tests of variables included in the estimated marginal "
"means against 0. The null hypothesis states that the estimated marginal mean "
"for a given level equals the tested value."
msgstr ""
"推定周辺平均に含めた変数について、0と比較する係数の検定を含めます。帰無仮説"
"は、ある水準の推定周辺平均が検定する値に等しい、というものです。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Adjusted effect size estimate"
msgstr "調整済みの効果量の推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the adjusted effect size estimate in the estimated marginal means "
"section."
msgstr "推定周辺平均のセクションに、調整済みの効果量の推定値を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Model information"
msgstr "モデルの情報"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Add meta-analytic model information to the forest plot."
msgstr "メタ分析モデルの情報をフォレストプロットに追加します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "異質性"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Test"
msgstr "検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the residual heterogeneity in the model information "
"section."
msgstr "モデルの情報のセクションに、残差の異質性の検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Wald test"
msgstr "ワルド検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the Wald-type test of the residual heterogeneity in the model "
"information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、残差の異質性についてのワルド型の検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Likelihood ratio test"
msgstr "尤度比検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the likelihood ratio test of the residual heterogeneity in the model "
"information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、残差の異質性についての尤度比検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Estimate"
msgstr "推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "𝜏"
msgstr "𝜏"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic 𝜏, the square root of the estimated between-study "
"variance in the model information section. Not available for multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、推定された研究間分散の平方根であるメタ分析の𝜏を含"
"めます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析では利用できません。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic 𝜏², the estimated between-study variance in the "
"model information section. Not available for multilevel/multivariate meta-"
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、推定された研究間分散であるメタ分析の𝜏²を含めま"
"す。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析では利用できません。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "I²"
msgstr "I²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "H²"
msgstr "H²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Moderation test"
msgstr "モデレーションの検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus heterogeneity moderation test in the model information "
"section. Available when heterogeneity meta-regression is specified."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、異質性のモデレーションについてのオムニバス検定を"
"含めます。異質性のメタ回帰を指定した場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Effect Size"
msgstr "効果量"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Fixed effect estimate"
msgstr "固定効果の推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include a fixed effect meta-analytic effect size estimate in the model "
"information section. Not available if the model was already fitted with "
"fixed effects or the model contains heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、固定効果によるメタ分析の効果量の推定値を含めま"
"す。すでに固定効果でモデルをあてはめている場合や、モデルに異質性のメタ回帰が"
"含まれている場合には利用できません。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Fixed effect estimate test"
msgstr "固定効果の推定値の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the fixed effect meta-analytic effect size estimate in "
"the model information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、固定効果によるメタ分析の効果量の推定値の検定を含"
"めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Pooled estimate"
msgstr "統合推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the model "
"information section."
msgstr "モデルの情報のセクションに、メタ分析の全体の効果量の推定値を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Pooled estimate test"
msgstr "統合推定値の検定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the "
"model information section."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、メタ分析の全体の効果量の推定値の検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the "
"model information section. If a meta-regression model is fitted, the test "
"corresponds to either the adjusted effect or the meta-regression intercept "
"term and the corresponding estimate is also displayed. The test is available "
"only if Bayesian model averaging for the effect is selected."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、メタ分析の全体の効果量の推定値の検定を含めます。"
"メタ回帰モデルをあてはめている場合、この検定は調整済みの効果またはメタ回帰の"
"切片の項に対応し、対応する推定値もあわせて表示されます。この検定は、効果につ"
"いてベイズモデル平均を選んだ場合にのみ利用できます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus effect size moderation test in the model information "
"section. Available when effect size meta-regression is specified."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、効果量のモデレーションについてのオムニバス検定を"
"含めます。効果量のメタ回帰を指定した場合に使えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Publication Bias"
msgstr "出版バイアス"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Include the publication bias test in the model information section."
msgstr "モデルの情報のセクションに、出版バイアスの検定を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "General"
msgstr "全般"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Prediction intervals"
msgstr "予測区間"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include prediction intervals of the estimated marginal means and the model "
"information output."
msgstr "推定周辺平均とモデルの情報の出力に、予測区間を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Estimates and confidence intervals"
msgstr "推定値と信頼区間"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include effect size estimates and confidence intervals summary text in the "
"right panel."
msgstr "右のパネルに、効果量の推定値と信頼区間をまとめた文章を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Conditional estimates"
msgstr "条件つき推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Display the conditional effect, heterogeneity, and estimated marginal means "
"estimates."
msgstr "条件つきの効果、異質性、推定周辺平均の推定値を表示します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Tests in right panel"
msgstr "右のパネルに検定結果"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Move test results text to the right panel."
msgstr "検定結果の文章を右のパネルに移します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Align left panel"
msgstr "左のパネルの配置"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中央"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Specify the forest plot behavior for subgroup analysis."
msgstr "サブグループ分析のときのフォレストプロットの振る舞いを指定します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Show subgroup titles"
msgstr "サブグループのタイトルを表示"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Show the subgroup heading labels in the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットにサブグループの見出しのラベルを表示します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Panels within subgroup"
msgstr "サブグループ内にパネルを配置"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Group the output panels within their subgroup membership."
msgstr "出力のパネルを、それが属するサブグループごとにまとめます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Full dataset estimated marginal means"
msgstr "全データの推定周辺平均"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset estimated marginal means in the forest plot if "
"subgroups are specified."
msgstr ""
"サブグループを指定している場合に、全データの推定周辺平均をフォレストプロット"
"に含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Full dataset model information"
msgstr "全データのモデルの情報"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset model information in the forest plot if subgroups "
"are specified."
msgstr ""
"サブグループを指定している場合に、全データのモデルの情報をフォレストプロット"
"に含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Auxiliary"
msgstr "補助"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Digits"
msgstr "桁数"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Number of digits printed for the effect size and confidence intervals "
"summary text."
msgstr "効果量と信頼区間をまとめた文章で表示する桁数です。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Tests information"
msgstr "検定の情報"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Statistic and p-value"
msgstr "統計量とp値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "P-value"
msgstr "p値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Color"
msgstr "色"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Change color of the plotted objects."
msgstr "描画する要素の色を変えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Black"
msgstr "黒"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "青"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Red"
msgstr "赤"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Add vertical line"
msgstr "垂直線を追加"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Add a solid vertical line in the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットに実線の垂直線を追加します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Add vertical line (2)"
msgstr "垂直線を追加(2)"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Add a dotted vertical line in the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットに点線の垂直線を追加します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "X-axis"
msgstr "x軸"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Label"
msgstr "ラベル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Change the x-axis label of the forest plot."
msgstr "フォレストプロットのx軸のラベルを変えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "範囲"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Change the default x-axis limits."
msgstr "既定のx軸の範囲を変えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Lower"
msgstr "下限"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Upper"
msgstr "上限"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Ticks"
msgstr "目盛"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Specify x-axis ticks manually as comma-separated numbers or fractions."
msgstr "x軸の目盛を、カンマ区切りの数値または分数で手動で指定します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Transform labels only"
msgstr "ラベルのみ変換"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Apply the selected effect size transformation only to the x-axis labels."
msgstr "選んだ効果量の変換を、x軸のラベルにのみ適用します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大きさ"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Adjust the size of the forest plot elements."
msgstr "フォレストプロットの各要素の大きさを調整します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "推定値"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文字"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Axis labels"
msgstr "軸のラベル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Left panel"
msgstr "左のパネル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Plot area"
msgstr "描画領域"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Right panel"
msgstr "右のパネル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Mapping"
msgstr "対応づけ"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for encoding the color or shape of the plotted objects."
msgstr "描画する要素の色または形を決める変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Selected Variables"
msgstr "選択した変数"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Select variables containing study-level information to be printed in the "
"left section of the panel."
msgstr "パネルの左側に表示する研究ごとの情報が入っている変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "タイトル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "幅"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "配置"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Adjust the Title, Width, and Alignment of each column in the left section."
msgstr "左側の各列のタイトル・幅・配置を調整します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中央"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Predicted effects"
msgstr "予測された効果"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Include predicted effect sizes in the middle section of the study-level "
"information panel."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報のパネルの中央のセクションに、予測された効果量を含めます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Study weights"
msgstr "研究の重み"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Include study weights in the right section of the study-level information "
"panel. For multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis, diagonal model weights are "
"shown, matching the default forest plot point-size weights."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報のパネルの右側のセクションに、研究の重みを含めます。マルチレベ"
"ル・多変量メタ分析では対角のモデルの重みが表示され、既定のフォレストプロット"
"の点の大きさの重みと一致します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "パーセンテージ"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Display user-supplied weights as percentages."
msgstr "ユーザが指定した重みをパーセンテージで表示します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Normalized"
msgstr "正規化"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Normalize displayed user-supplied weights to sum to 100."
msgstr "表示するユーザ指定の重みを、合計が100になるように正規化します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Secondary confidence interval"
msgstr "副次的な信頼区間"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Include secondary confidence interval for effect sizes in the middle section "
"of the study-level information panel."
msgstr ""
"研究ごとの情報のパネルの中央のセクションに、効果量の副次的な信頼区間を含めま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "順序"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Order the study-level information panel by a variable."
msgstr "研究ごとの情報のパネルを変数で並べ替えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "By"
msgstr "基準"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable by which the study-level information panel is ordered."
msgstr "研究ごとの情報のパネルを並べ替える基準の変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Ascending"
msgstr "昇順"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Order the study-level information panel in ascending order."
msgstr "研究ごとの情報のパネルを昇順に並べ替えます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Aggregate"
msgstr "集約"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Aggregate the study-level information panel by a variable."
msgstr "研究ごとの情報のパネルを変数で集約します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable by which the study-level information panel is aggregated."
msgstr "研究ごとの情報のパネルを集約する基準の変数を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Select the method for aggregating the estimates."
msgstr "推定値を集約する方法を選びます。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Boxplot"
msgstr "箱ひげ図"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Aggregate the estimates by boxplot."
msgstr "推定値を箱ひげ図で集約します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Bubbles"
msgstr "バブル"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Aggregate the estimates by bubbles."
msgstr "推定値をバブルで集約します。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotStudyInformation|"
msgid "Relative size"
msgstr "相対的な大きさ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Create risk-of-bias visualizations from systematic review quality "
"assessments. Supports RoB 2, ROBINS-I, and QUADAS-2."
msgstr ""
"系統的レビューの質の評価から、バイアスのリスクの可視化を作ります。RoB 2、"
"ROBINS-I、QUADAS-2に対応しています。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "文献"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Rパッケージ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Assessment tool"
msgstr "評価ツール"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the risk-of-bias assessment tool used for the systematic review. Each "
"tool expects a specific number of domain columns with specific judgment "
"values."
msgstr ""
"系統的レビューで使ったバイアスのリスクの評価ツールを選びます。ツールごとに、"
"必要なドメインの列数と判定値が決まっています。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "RoB 2"
msgstr "RoB 2"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "ROBINS-I"
msgstr "ROBINS-I"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "QUADAS-2"
msgstr "QUADAS-2"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Study Label"
msgstr "研究のラベル"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Variable containing study identifiers."
msgstr "研究の識別子が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D1: Randomisation"
msgstr "D1: 無作為化"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D2: Deviations from interventions"
msgstr "D2: 意図した介入からの逸脱"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D3: Missing outcome data"
msgstr "D3: アウトカムデータの欠測"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D4: Measurement of outcome"
msgstr "D4: アウトカムの測定"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D5: Selection of reported result"
msgstr "D5: 報告する結果の選択"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D1: Confounding"
msgstr "D1: 交絡"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D2: Selection of participants"
msgstr "D2: 参加者の選択"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D3: Classification of interventions"
msgstr "D3: 介入の分類"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D4: Deviations from interventions"
msgstr "D4: 意図した介入からの逸脱"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D5: Missing data"
msgstr "D5: データの欠測"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D6: Measurement of outcomes"
msgstr "D6: アウトカムの測定"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D7: Selection of reported result"
msgstr "D7: 報告する結果の選択"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D1: Patient selection"
msgstr "D1: 患者の選択"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D2: Index test"
msgstr "D2: 対象とする検査"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D3: Reference standard"
msgstr "D3: 参照基準"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "D4: Flow & timing"
msgstr "D4: フローとタイミング"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Overall Judgment"
msgstr "全体の判定"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Variable containing the overall risk-of-bias judgment for each study."
msgstr "研究ごとのバイアスのリスクの全体的な判定が入っている変数です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "重み"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Variable containing study weights for weighted summary plots (e.g., inverse-"
"variance weights)."
msgstr ""
"重みつきの要約プロットに使う研究の重み(分散の逆数による重みなど)が入っている"
"変数です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Summary plot"
msgstr "要約プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a bar chart showing the distribution of risk-of-bias judgments "
"across domains."
msgstr "ドメインごとのバイアスのリスクの判定の分布を示す棒グラフを表示します。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Weighted by study precision"
msgstr "研究の精度で重みづけ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Weight the summary bars by study precision. Requires a weights variable."
msgstr "要約の棒を研究の精度で重みづけします。重みの変数が必要です。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Traffic light plot"
msgstr "信号機プロット"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display a matrix of colored circles showing per-study, per-domain risk-of-"
"bias judgments."
msgstr ""
"研究ごと・ドメインごとのバイアスのリスクの判定を、色付きの円の行列で表示しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Point size"
msgstr "点の大きさ"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Size of the traffic light circles."
msgstr "信号機の円の大きさです。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外観"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Color scheme"
msgstr "カラースキーム"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Select the color palette for risk-of-bias judgments."
msgstr "バイアスのリスクの判定に使うカラーパレットを選びます。"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Cochrane"
msgstr "Cochrane"

msgctxt "RiskOfBiasPlot|"
msgid "Colourblind"
msgstr "色覚に配慮"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic I², the percentage of total variation across "
"studies due to heterogeneity in the model information section. Not available "
"for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、研究間の全変動のうち異質性によるものの割合である"
"メタ分析のI²を含めます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のメタ回帰では利"
"用できません。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic H², an index indicating the ratio of total "
"variability to sampling variability in the model information section. Not "
"available for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-"
"regression."
msgstr ""
"モデルの情報のセクションに、全体のばらつきと標本抽出によるばらつきの比を表す"
"指標であるメタ分析のH²を含めます。マルチレベル・多変量メタ分析や異質性のメタ"
"回帰では利用できません。"
